      "statement": "SENSOR_BME680_BSEC_STATE_VERSION must be incremented whenever the indoor BME680 sensor is physically replaced, because the persisted BSEC baseline NVS state is keyed by I2C address and this version number, and applying an old sensor's baseline to a different physical sensor would corrupt its IAQ calibration.",
