    {
      "id": "claim_af92e8ef93224ad9987ad6109e8e26f0",
      "statement": "Integration of the vehicle's original WoMo tank sensors (4-level reed/resistor-network interface) is blocked because GPIO17/GPIO18, originally earmarked as free pins for this feature, were committed to the light and pump switched outputs instead as of 2026-08-30; a different pair of free GPIOs must be chosen before this integration can proceed.",
