    {
      "id": "claim_30508b49294e44d3a967f6fd79c2f7b6",
      "statement": "No automatic under-voltage shutoff exists for the 12V house battery; the Sensorboard only switches the HS relay on explicit Display command. The Schaudt EBL's own automatic battery-guard cutoff behavior (reportedly ~10.6V for >60s on some newer models) is documented only as an unverified reference model, not as a confirmed threshold for the EBL 262-3 unit in this vehicle, and no threshold/timer has been decided for this project.",
      "evidence": [
        {
